clarations/index.html">Lean declarations</a><a href="../../implementation-map/index.html">Implementation map</a><a href="../../lean-graph/index.html">Lean Graph</a><a href="../../proof-graph-laboratory/index.html">Proof Graph Laboratory</a></div></details><details class="nav-group" data-nav-group="formalize" data-nav-group-active="false"><summary class="nav-group-title"><span>Formalize</span><span class="nav-group-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div class="nav-group-links"><a href="../../ide/index.html">Local Formalization Lab</a><a href="../../workflow/index.html">ABRL Harness</a></div></details><details class="nav-group" data-nav-group="community" data-nav-group-active="false"><summary class="nav-group-title"><span>Community</span><span class="nav-group-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div class="nav-group-links"><a href="../../community/index.html">Contribute</a><a href="../../contributors/index.html">Contributors</a><a href="../../roadmap/index.html">Roadmap</a><a href="../../attribution/index.html">Attribution</a></div></details>
